== History ==
2026
* On 4/5/2026, with the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (4/5/2026)|May 2026 Update]] the Hero Bowler was added into the game, along with [[Dark Prince/Hero|Hero Dark Prince]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 1/6/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/6/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased his ability duration to 7.3 seconds (from 9 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 4/8/2026, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Bowler's projectile range to 7 tiles (from 7.5 tiles){{Balance|Nerf}}. This also made the ability single use (from 22sec cooldown){{Balance|Remove}}.

